// Title: Webshell ReGeorg Detection Via Web Logs
// ID: 2ea44a60-cfda-11ea-87d0-0242ac130003
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Cian Heasley
// Date: 2020-08-04
// Tags: attack.persistence, attack.t1505.003
// Description: Certain strings in the uri_query field when combined with null referer and null user agent can indicate activity associated with the webshell ReGeorg.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

_sourceCategory=* | where (((cs-uri-query matches "*cmd=read*" or cs-uri-query matches "*connect&target*" or cs-uri-query matches "*cmd=connect*" or cs-uri-query matches "*cmd=disconnect*" or cs-uri-query matches "*cmd=forward*")) and (isNull(cs-referer) and isNull(cs-user-agent) and cs-method = "POST"))
